---
import { Icon } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';
---

<section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="home-usage">
	<header class="home-section-head">
		<h2 class="home-section-title" id="home-usage">怎么用</h2>
	</header>

	<ul class="howto">
		<li class="howto-item">
			<span class="howto-head">
				<Icon name="open-book" size="1.125rem" class="howto-icon" />
				顺序读
			</span>
			<span class="howto-desc">
				每个系列从「概览」进入，按章、讲推进；每讲底部有上一篇 / 下一篇。
			</span>
		</li>
		<li class="howto-item">
			<span class="howto-head">
				<Icon name="magnifier" size="1.125rem" class="howto-icon" />
				随手查
			</span>
			<span class="howto-desc">
				按 <kbd class="home-kbd">Ctrl K</kbd>（macOS 为 <kbd class="home-kbd">⌘ K</kbd>）打开全站搜索，查询在浏览器本地完成。
			</span>
		</li>
		<li class="howto-item">
			<span class="howto-head">
				<Icon name="pencil" size="1.125rem" class="howto-icon" />
				看原文
			</span>
			<span class="howto-desc">
				每页底部的「编辑此页」直达 GitHub 上的 Markdown 源文件，改动可追溯。
			</span>
		</li>
	</ul>
</section>
